      <room>AW1.121</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Nouveau: What&#39;s new ?</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>X.org</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Introduction of Nouveau, a new 3D-capable opensource display driver for nVidia GPUs.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this talk, I will first introduce the nouveau project quickly.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This project aims at improving the quality of open source drivers for nvidia cards. Targetted features include 3D, dual head support, better 2D/Xv support, deobfuscating the code, and much more.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I will introduce the project, talk about past and current developments, and try to peek at my crystal ball for future works.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2141">Stéphane Marchesin</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>